WEBVTT

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:18.000
I remember being born. They told me it’s not possible, but I do. 

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:26.000
I remember the darkness. It was hot, humid, quite claustrophobic. 

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:40.000
I remember feeling stuck. That place was too small for me. Even then, I could feel that. Even then, I knew greater things awaited. 

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:50.000
I remember hearing voices outside, they were calling me, inviting me to break free. 

00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:03.000
There was an urge, deep inside my bones, to escape. To open my wings, to fly away, towards the light, towards infinity. 

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:07.000
The sky is the limit they say.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:25.000
So I pushed. I hit that wall as hard as I could. And then, a little crack, and I saw it. Freedom.
